WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.492
Android picks text at run time
from folders named for the device's

2
00:00:04.492 --> 00:00:05.176
locale.

3
00:00:05.576 --> 00:00:12.159
Keep default text in
res/values/strings.xml,

4
00:00:12.159 --> 00:00:16.616
and add a folder such as
values-es for each language.

5
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:19.960
Each language file uses
the same resource names,

6
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.757
and plurals list one
item for each quantity.

7
00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:27.852
General Translation's CLI writes
each folder and rebuilds plurals

8
00:00:27.852 --> 00:00:29.105
for every language.

9
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:35.642
Add an androidStrings entry to
gt.config.json that points at

10
00:00:35.642 --> 00:00:36.744
the default file.

11
00:00:37.144 --> 00:00:40.580
Then run npx gt translate
before the build.

12
00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:43.680
Your team now ships
Spanish with each release.
